{"id":"en_kicked-out-i-took-the-company","title":"Kicked Out, I Took the Company","titleEn":"Kicked Out, I Took the Company","description":"At the Lowe family's Coming-of-Age Ceremony, Chase Lowe is publicly revealed to be a fake heir. Jason Lowe seizes the credit for himself, and Clara Sullivan ends her relationship with Chase. Cast aside by those around him, Chase activates the Market Oracle and departs with the company's most valuable personnel. He then sets out to build a fresh empire with the aim of bringing down everyone who wronged him. His plan is complicated, however, when the Market Oracle begins to demand its own price.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/kicked-out-i-took-the-company/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/kicked-out-i-took-the-company/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Feel-Good","Underdog Rise","Urban Life","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7ds2zg/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_kicked-out-i-took-the-company_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7ds2zg/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_kicked-out-i-took-the-company_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7ds2zg/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_kicked-out-i-took-the-company_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7ds2zg/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_kicked-out-i-took-the-company_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embe